 Performance Level 6","level":"Higher Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Music Technology Level 6","level":"Higher Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}],"sources":{"about":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/","courses":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/","description":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021","accreditations":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021"},"facilities":[],"description":"Aberdares School of Music and Performing Arts occupies the fifth floor of Hanton Towers on Mama Ngina Street in Thika town and offers music and performing-arts training in cohort-limited classes of up to 20 trainees per programme. The published programme list covers Film Production at Level 6, Music Art at Level 5, Music Performance at Level 6 and Music Technology at Level 6, all assessed by TVET CDACC. The institution''s postal address is published as Box 6458-00100 Thika together with two telephone lines and a Gmail contact address. The TVETA register carries the school as Category TVC, Type Private, County Kiambu, registered on 2021-10-22 with a nominal expiry of 2026-10-21; as at this fetched record the regulator shows the licence as Expired and publishes no accredited course table, so the programme list here is taken from the published directory entry that reproduces the regulator''s course data.","accreditations":["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021, registered 2021-10-22, nominal expiry 2026-10-21 - the live TVETA record now shows the licence as Expired","Programmes assessed by TVET CDACC"]},"basic_info":{"email":"aberdaresschoolofmusic@gmail.com","phone":"0111819000 / 0702373754","sources":{"email":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-applicat