stitution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021"},"basic_info.location.location":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"The cited directory page states ''Physical Location: Hanton Towers 5Th Floor, Mama Ngina Street'', matching the stored address string.","url_checked":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/"},"institution_profile.has_elearning":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"Record asserts ''none''. No institutional website or LMS is published on the register or directory page, so the negative assertion stands.","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021"},"institution_profile.has_distance_learning":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"Record asserts ''none''. Neither the register entry nor the directory page publishes ODeL or distance provision; delivery is described as studio and classroom training in Thika.","url_checked":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/"}}', '{"type":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021","email":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/","phone":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/","campuses":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/","category":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021","location":"https://education.co.ke/aberdares-school-of-music-and-performing-arts-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/","ownership":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021","has_elearning":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0083/2021","lo