tails=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","courses":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","description":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","accreditations":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"},"facilities":[],"description":"The ACK Bishop Hannington Institute of Theology and Development Studies is listed in the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority register of accredited institutions as a privately owned technical and vocational college in Mombasa County under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016, an institution of the Anglican Church of Kenya. The register snapshot of 25 October 2026 records the licence as ''Registered and Licensed'' with an expiry date of 24 October 2029. The authority''s accredited programme table for the institute records two KASNEB awards: the Accounting Technicians Diploma, recorded at diploma level, and Certified Public Accountants, recorded at professional level. Only the diploma award is recorded as a course entry here because the schema''s qualification levels cover certificate through doctorate and cannot represent an ungraded professional qualification, and no exam body or level is invented for it. The regulator publishes no campus address, telephone, email or e-learning portal for the institute, and no institution-owned source could be consulted in this pass, so those fields are left empty rather than estimated.","accreditations":["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016, licence status ''Registered and Licensed'', expiry 2029-10-24","KASNEB examination for the accredited accounting awards"]},"basic_info":{"email":null,"phone":"020 2615380","sources":{"location.county":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","location.region":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"},"website":null,"lo