/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"},"institution_profile.type":{"notes":"Accredited TVET institution on the TVET Authority register; type TVET stands.","status":"confirmed","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"},"basic_info.location.county":{"notes":"Register detail page for TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016 prints ''County: Mombasa'' for ''ACK BISHOP HANNINGTON INSTITUTE OF THEOLOGY AND DEVELOPMENT STUDIES''; county and Coast region stand. The page publishes no street address or town, so the locality value carried from the record''s identity column is not corroborated by this source (not_found is not contradiction).","status":"confirmed","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"},"institution_profile.category":{"notes":"Detail page prints ''Category: TVC''.","status":"confirmed","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"},"institution_profile.ownership":{"notes":"Detail page prints ''Type: Private''.","status":"confirmed","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"}}', '{"type":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","category":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","ownership":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","has_elearning":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","location.county":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","location.region":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016","has_distance_learning":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016"}', 46, 'researched', '2026-10-24 09:16:03.56084+00', '2026-11-20 17:55:31.495077+00', 'not_applied', '2026-10-30 05:38:42.252992+00', 't_fd5f06b8', '[]', 'unverified', null, null, null, null, null, 0, null, 'verification', null, null, 'register', 'Requeued to re_research afresh under the new process', null, 're_research', 1, 0, 0, null, null, '["none","No e-learning or learning-management-system portal is recorded for this institute in the TVETA register entry and none is evidenced from an institution-owned source."]', '["none","No distance-learning or ODeL provision is published in the TVETA register entry for TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016 and no institutional portal is evidenced."]', '[false,"The accredited programmes are KASNEB accountancy awards; no teacher-training programme is published."]', '[]', '[]', 'ACK Bishop Hannington Institute of Theology and Development Studies is a private technical and vocational college in Mombasa County registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016. Its accredited programme table records a KASNEB accounting technicians diploma alongside KASNEB professional accountancy awards.', 'The ACK Bishop Hannington Institute of Theology and Development Studies is listed in the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority register of accredited institutions as a privately owned technical and vocational college in Mombasa County under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016, an institution of the Anglican Church of Kenya. The register snapshot of 25 October 2026 records the licence as ''Registered and Licensed'' with an expiry date of 24 October 2029. The authority''s accredited programme table for the institute records two KASNEB awards: the Accounting Technicians Diploma, recorded at diploma level, and Certified Public Accountants, recorded at professional level. Only the diploma award is recorded as a course entry here because the schema''s qualification levels cover certificate through doctorate and cannot represent an ungraded professional qualification, and no exam body or level is invented for it. The regulator publishes no campus address, telephone, email or e-learning portal for the institute, and no institution-owned source could be consulted in this pass, so those fields are left empty rather than estimated.', '[]', '["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2016, licence status ''Registered and Licensed'', expiry 2029-10-24","KASNEB examination for the accredited accounting awards"]', '[{"name":"Accounting Technicians Diploma","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KASNEB"}]', '[]', 52, '{}', '[]', null, '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'pending', null, null, null);
