.","courses":[],"sources":null,"facilities":[],"description":"TVETA records Acropolis College of Medical and Professional Studies as a private technical and vocational college in Nairobi County under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024, registered on 1 August 2024 and licensed to 31 July 2029 with the status Registered and Licensed. The authority''s course register lists accredited programmes in community health, health records and information technology, perioperative theatre technology, caregiving and health systems support management at CDACC levels 4 to 6. A Wayback Machine capture of the college''s website dated 22 March 2025 shows it advertising diplomas in perioperative theatre technology, community health and development, and ophthalmic technology, each of two years and open to KCSE candidates with a C minus, plus a one-year certificate in community health and development. The same captured page describes the college as offering competency-based education and training aligned to TVETA and CDACC standards, and publishes a WhatsApp contact line on +254 719 855 555; no institutional e-mail address appears on the captured page.","accreditations":["Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority (TVETA) - Registered and Licensed, TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024, registered 2024-08-01, expires 2029-07-31","Programmes aligned to TVET CDACC competency-based standards, as stated on the college''s own website"]},"basic_info":{"email":null,"phone":"0719855555","sources":null,"website":"https://www.acropolis.ac.ke/","location":"5th Floor, Sunny Plaza, 5th Parklands Opposite The Concord Hotel","logo_url":null},"personal_contacts":[],"institution_profile":{"type":"TVET","sources":null,"campuses":[],"category":"TVC","ownership":"private","affiliation":[],"has_elearning":["none","The captured site publishes no e-learning portal, LMS or virtual classroom URL."],"registration_status":"Registered and Licensed","has_teaching_courses":[true],"has_distance_learning":["none","No ODeL or distance-learning programme is advertised on the captured college site."],"estimated_student_count":null}}', '{"context":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"Confirmed context via TVETA registry and archive.","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024"},"basic_info":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"Confirmed basic info via TVETA registry and archive.","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024"},"personal_contacts":{"status":"not_found","rationale":"No personal contacts listed.","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024"},"institution_profile":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"Confirmed institution profile.","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024"}}', '{"type":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024","phone":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250322052455/https://www.acropolis.ac.ke/","website":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250322052455/https://www.acropolis.ac.ke/","category":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024","location":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250322052455/https://www.acropolis.ac.ke/","ownership":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024"}', 38, 'researched', '2026-10-24 09:16:03.56084+00', '2026-11-20 17:55:31.495077+00', 'not_applied', '2026-11-08 22:22:10.129126+00', 'sync:drain:S4', '[]', 'unverified', null, null, null, null, null, 0, null, 'sync', null, null, 'none', 'Requeued to re_research afresh under the new process', '2026-11-07 20:17:34.842308+00', 're_research', 1, 0, 0, null, null, '["none","The captured site publishes no e-learning portal, LMS or virtual classroom URL."]', '["none","No ODeL or distance-learning programme is advertised on the captured college site."]', '[true]', '[]', '[]', 'Acropolis College of Medical and Professional Studies is a private technical and vocational college in Nairobi County, registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024. The college describes itself as Nairobi''s destination for medical education, offering competency-based education and training programmes aligned to TVETA and CDACC standards across medical and health sciences, social sciences and ICT.', 'TVETA records Acropolis College of Medical and Professional Studies as a private technical and vocational college in Nairobi County under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024, registered on 1 August 2024 and licensed to 31 July 2029 with the status Registered and Licensed. The authority''s course register lists accredited programmes in community health, health records and information technology, perioperative theatre technology, caregiving and health systems support management at CDACC levels 4 to 6. A Wayback Machine capture of the college''s website dated 22 March 2025 shows it advertising diplomas in perioperative theatre technology, community health and development, and ophthalmic technology, each of two years and open to KCSE candidates with a C minus, plus a one-year certificate in community health and development. The same captured page describes the college as offering competency-based education and training aligned to TVETA and CDACC standards, and publishes a WhatsApp contact line on +254 719 855 555; no institutional e-mail address appears on the captured page.', '[]', '["Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority (TVETA) - Registered and Licensed, TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0061/2024, registered 2024-08-01, expires 2029-07-31","Programmes aligned to TVET CDACC competency-based standards, as stated on the college''s own website"]', '[]', '[]', 62, '{}', '[]', null, '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'pending', null, null, null);
