lephone number, street address, student population or named officer is published in the register or discoverable from a fetched source, so the campus location, contacts and leadership of this institute remain unconfirmed in this record.', '[]', '["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0190/2025, registered 2025-11-06, licence valid to 2030-11-05, status ''Registered and Licensed''","TVET Curriculum Development, Assessment and Certification Council (TVET CDACC) assessment for all three accredited Level 5 programmes"]', '[{"name":"Animation and Digital Media (Level 5)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology (Level 5)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Product Design (Level 5)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}]', '[]', 37, '{}', '[]', null, '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'packaged', '2026-11-22 15:09:14.07623+00', '2026-11-22 15:09:14.07623+00', null);
