iness Management at craft level (KNEC), while the institution''s website advertises Certified Public Accountant (CPA), Accounting Technician Diploma, Accountancy, Secretarial Studies, Full Stack Web Development and Computer Packages. The colleges.co.ke directory places the college in Nakuru Town West Constituency, Nakuru County, and lists NVCET certificate and NITA artisan programmes in electrical installation, fashion design and garment making, food processing technology and information communication technology. The college operates two campuses in Nakuru: the Main Campus at Shawmut Plaza, 6th Floor, Nakuru CBD, and a Section 58 Campus opposite Optimum Hospital along Kinuthia Mbugua Road.","accreditations":["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0003/2016, registered 2016-01-28, licence valid to 2028-10-08, status ''Registered and Licensed''","Website self-lists accreditation and partnerships with KNEC, TVET CDACC, ABMA, KASNEB and TVETA"]},"basic_info":{"email":"info@adeptcollege.ac.ke","phone":"+254706677132","sources":{"town":["https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-adept-college-professional-studies"],"email":["https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/"],"phone":["https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/"],"county":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0003/2016","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-adept-college-professional-studies"],"region":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0003/2016"],"website":["https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/"],"location":["https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/"],"logo_url":["https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/"]},"website":"https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/","location":{"town":"Nakuru","county":"Nakuru County","region":"Rift Valley","location":"Shawmut Plaza, 6th Floor, Nakuru CBD"},"logo_url":"https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/adept/adept.png"},"personal_contacts":[],"institution_profile":{"type":"TVET","sources":{"type":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE