al website) was registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority on 28 January 2016 under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0003/2016. The regulator''s register shows the licence running to 8 October 2028 with the status ''Registered and Licensed''. The authority''s course table lists Accounting Technicians Diploma (KASNEB), Certified Public Accountants (professional level, KASNEB), and Business Management (craft/certificate level, KNEC). Its official website (https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/) lists its Main Campus at Shawmut Plaza, 6th Floor, Nakuru CBD (phone +254 706 677 132), a Section 58 Campus opposite Optimum Hospital along Kinuthia Mbugua Rd (phone +254 119 927 724), and email info@adeptcollege.ac.ke. Colleges.co.ke also lists it as a private college in Nakuru Town West Constituency, Nakuru County, offering KNEC and NITA certificate programmes.","old_val":"Adept College of Professional Studies was registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority on 28 January 2016 under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0003/2016. The regulator''s register shows the licence running to 8 October 2028 with the status ''Registered and Licensed''. The authority''s course table for this college lists three entries: the Accounting Technicians Diploma examined by the Kenya Accountants and Secretaries National Examinations Board, Certified Public Accountants at professional level under the same board, and Business Management at craft level examined by the Kenya National Examinations Council. Craft level is recorded here as certificate. The Certified Public Accountants entry is a professional qualification whose level has no equivalent in this schema''s enumerated course levels, so it is not listed as a course entry; this is recorded here rather than represented as a diploma or certificate it is not. No institutional e-mail address, telephone line, postal address or street-level location was confirmed on any page fetched during this run, so those fields are recorded as null or unknown rather than carried over from unverified import data. The college is a private TVC in Nakuru County, within Kenya''s Rift Valley region.","rationale":"The stored narrative asserts ''No institutional e-mail address, telephone line, postal address or street-level location was confirmed on any page fetched during this run'' - that assertion is now false and conflicts with the same call''s gap promotions. Syncer re-fetched adeptcollege.ac.ke (HTTP 200, footer: Shawmut Plaza 6th Floor Nakuru CBD / Section 58 opposite Optimum Hospital / +254 706 677 132 / +254 119 927 724 / info@adeptcollege.ac.ke) and colleges.co.ke (HTTP 200: private college, Nakuru Town West Constituency, KNEC + NITA certificate programmes). The staging narrative keeps every register fact (registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0003/2016, 2016-01-28, licence to 2028-10-08, Registered and Licensed, ATD/CPA/Business Management with CPA documented as professional level) and adds only verified contacts, so it is a superset, not a downgrade.","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:20:01.796713+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_e4d50671","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0003/2016","https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-adept-college-professional-studies"]},{"field":"logo_url","action":"gap_sync","new_val":"https://adeptcollege.ac.ke/adept/adept.png","old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-21T09:55:30.895768+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync"},{"field":"facilities","action":"gap_sync","new_val":["Modern laboratories","Library and research resources","Innovation hub","Student clubs","Sports teams"],"old_val":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-21T09:55:30.895768+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync"},{"field":"has_elearning","action":"new_wins","new_val":["implied","The website advertises a ''Student Portal'' link, but no LMS/e-learning platform URL was found; a generic portal is not a verified LMS."],"old