":"Computer Packages","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Care Giving Program","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Office Administration Skills","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Office Administration","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"ICT","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Nursing","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Driving Test","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"}],"sources":{"about":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","courses":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/courses/","facilities":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","description":["https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","https://www.advancedctcollege.com/courses/","https://elimys.com/advanced-career-training-college","https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025"],"accreditations":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025"},"facilities":["Well-equipped teaching facilities","Quiet campus environment in Kitui Township"],"description":"Advanced Career Training College, which trades as ACT College, is a private TVC recorded in the TVETA register as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025 in Kitui County, with a licence current to 28 January 2030 and the status Registered and Licensed. The college''s published programme catalogue lists Business Management at Certificate and Diploma level, Information Communication Technology at Certificate and Diploma level, a Care Giving certificate, a Certified Nursing Assistant certificate, Computer Packages, IELTS preparation and a driving school with NTSA Class A, B1 and B2 licences. Its fees page states that certificate and diploma programmes carry the awarding body \"Varies\" together with an ACT College completion certificate, that Computer Packages and IELTS awards are issued by ACT College itself, and th