TA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025"],"has_elearning":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","accreditations":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025","has_teaching_courses":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/courses/","has_distance_learning":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/"},"basic_info":{"email":"hello@advancedctcollege.com","phone":"[\"+254 101 661 548\", \"+254 113 922 262\"]","sources":{"town":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","email":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","phone":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","county":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025","region":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025","website":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","location":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/"},"website":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","location":{"town":"Kitui","county":"Kitui County","region":"Eastern","location":"C - House, Level 3, Kitui Township"},"logo_url":null},"personal_contacts":[],"institution_profile":{"type":"TVET","sources":{"type":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025","campuses":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","category":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025","ownership":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025","affiliation":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","has_elearning":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","has_teaching_courses":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/courses/","has_distance_learning":"https://www.advancedctcollege.com/"},"campuses":["Kitui Campus — Kitui"],"category":"TVC","ownership":"private","affiliation":[],"has_elearning":["none","Online classes are advertised as a timetable option, but no learning-management-system or course-delivery portal URL is published."],"has_teaching_courses":[false,"Programmes are business, ICT, care-giving, office administration, nursing and driving; no teacher-training qualification is advertised."],"has_distance_learning":["implied","The college advertises morning, afternoon, weekend and online classes as delivery options, but no dedicated distance-learning portal or ODeL URL is published."],"estimated_student_count":null}}', '{"errors":[],"isValid":true,"is_valid":true,"warnings":[],"calculatedScore":75,"calculated_score":75,"normalized_fields":{"description":"Advanced Career Training College, which trades as ACT College, is a private TVC recorded in the TVETA register as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025 in Kitui County, with a licence current to 28 January 2030 and the status Registered and Licensed. The college''s published programme catalogue lists Business Management at Certificate and Diploma level, Information Communication Technology at Certificate and Diploma level, a Care Giving certificate, a Certified Nursing Assistant certificate, Computer Packages, IELTS preparation and a driving school with NTSA Class A, B1 and B2 licences. Its fees page states that certificate and diploma programmes carry the awarding body \"Varies\" together with an ACT College completion certificate, that Computer Packages and IELTS awards are issued by ACT College itself, and that the driving award is an ACT College certificate together with the NTSA driving licence. No published page names KNEC, TVET CDACC or NITA as the examining body for the Business Management, ICT, Care Giving or CNA programmes, and no Nursing diploma or Office Administration qualification appears on the current course catalogue even though both were carried in the imported record. The college occupies C - House, Level 3, Kitui Township along the Kitui-Kibwezi road, and publishes hello@advancedctcollege.com, admissions@advancedctcollege.com, a reception line on +254 101 661 548 and a calls/WhatsApp line on +254 113 922 262."},"normalized_sources":{"description":["https://www.advancedctcollege.com/","https://www.advancedctcollege.com/