ble option, but no learning-management-system or course-delivery portal URL is published."]', '["implied","The college advertises morning, afternoon, weekend and online classes as delivery options, but no dedicated distance-learning portal or ODeL URL is published."]', '[false,"Programmes are business, ICT, care-giving, office administration, nursing and driving; no teacher-training qualification is advertised."]', '["Kitui Campus — Kitui"]', '[]', 'Advanced Career Training College, trading as ACT College, is a private technical and vocational college in Kitui Township, Kitui County, registered and licensed by TVETA as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025 and teaching business, ICT, care-giving, office administration and driving programmes at certificate and diploma level.', 'Advanced Career Training College, which trades as ACT College, is a private TVC recorded in the TVETA register as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025 in Kitui County, with a licence current to 28 January 2030 and the status Registered and Licensed. The college teaches business, ICT, care-giving, office administration and driving programmes across certificate and diploma levels, and its site states that students receive certificate courses, diploma programmes and general skills short courses. It occupies C - House, Level 3, Kitui Township, describes itself as being in a quiet and accessible location for students coming from around Kitui, and offers morning, afternoon, weekend and online classes one module at a time. The published contact channels are the inbox hello@advancedctcollege.com, a reception line on +254 101 661 548 and a calls/WhatsApp line on +254 113 922 262. The imported record carried three United States campuses in Atlanta, Morrow and Jacksonville together with affiliations to United Education Institute and International Education Corporation and a student count of 1,062; those belong to a different, similarly named American institution and have been removed rather than carried forward.', '["Well-equipped teaching facilities","Quiet campus environment in Kitui Township"]', '["Registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority (TVETA) as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0002/2025, licence expiry 2030-01-28, status Registered and Licensed"]', '[{"name":"Business Management","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Business Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Computer Packages","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Care Giving Program","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Office Administration Skills","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Office Administration","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"ICT","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Nursing","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Driving Test","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"}]', '[]', 74, '{}', '[]', '2026-11-17 00:58:51.903051+00', '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'pending', null, null, null);
