0825+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.kenyaplex.com/colleges/2905-advent-college-of-technology.aspx","https://maps.google.com/?cid=5475594583074814418&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGl1Lm1hcHMucGxhY2VzLnYxLlBsYWNlcy5TZWFyY2hUZXh0EAJYBAgA"],"stored_value":"Section 6, J.M Kasriuki Road","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"Nairobi","locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"new_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: sourced teaching-courses correction (False -> True).","decided_at":"2026-11-21T20:07:30.600854+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"has_teaching_courses","settled_at":"2026-11-21T20:07:30.600854+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018"],"stored_value":[false,"The accredited programmes are business, ICT, sales and marketing and supply chain management courses; no teacher-training programme is listed."],"fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":[true,"Business Management (Craft)","Business Management (Diploma)","Information Communication Technology (Craft)","Information Communication Technology (Diploma)","Sales and Marketing (Craft)","Sales and Marketing (Diploma)","Supply Chain Management (Craft)","Supply Chain Management (Diploma)"],"locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"stored_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: free-text reworded; canonical narrative kept (reword is not a conflict).","decided_at":"2026-11-21T20:07:30.600861+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"about","settled_at":"2026-11-21T20:07:30.600861+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018","https://www.kenyaplex.com/colleges/2905-advent-college-of-technology.aspx"],"stored_value":"Advent College of Technology is a private technical and vocational college registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018 and located in Nairobi County, Kenya. It is accredited for KNEC examined craft and diploma programmes in business management, information communication technology, sales and marketing and supply chain management.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"Advent College of Technology is a private technical and vocational college in Nairobi, Kenya, registered by TVETA as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018 and located on J.M Kariuki Road area, Nairobi. It is a KNEC examination centre offering KNEC-examined craft and diploma programmes in business management, information communication technology, sales and marketing and supply chain management.","locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"stored_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: free-text reworded; canonical narrative kept (reword is not a conflict).","decided_at":"2026-11-21T20:07:30.600868+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"description","settled_at":"2026-11-21T20:07:30.600868+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018","https://www.kenyaplex.com/colleges/2905-advent-college-of-technology.aspx","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-advent-college-technology"],"stored_value":"Advent College of Technology is a privately owned technical and vocational college in Nairobi County licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018, registered on 12 April 2018 with a licence valid to 7 March 2029. Its accredited offer is entirely KNEC examined. The register records the same four business-oriented programme areas at both craft and diploma level, giving eight accredited qualifications in total: business management, information communication technology, sales and marketing, and supply chain management. The licence status is recorded as Registered and Licensed. No institution-owned website or published telephone contact for this college was evidenced during this research pass, so those fields are left empty rather than guessed.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"Advent College of Technology is a privately owned technical and vocational college in Nairobi County, Kenya, licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018, registered on 12 April 2018 with a licence valid to 7 March 2029. Its accredited offer is entirely KNEC examined, covering business management, information communication technology, sales and marketing and supply chain management, each offered at both craft and diploma level for eight accredited qualifications in total. Third-party listings further describe the college as a KNEC-certified examination centre for ICT and business studies, operating from Mima Center Building in Donholm, above Equity Bank, 2nd floor, room 16, Nairobi. The college''s own website domain (adventcollege.ac.ke) listed on directory pages does not currently resolve, and no institution-owned social media pages or learning management system were found in this research pass.","locked_by_verification":false}]', 'verified', '2026-11-21 20:07:30.995285+00', 'c8e65487d75f', null, null, null, 1, null, 'verification', null, null, 'register', null, '2026-11-07 20:17:34.842308+00', null, 1, 1, 0, null, null, '["none","No e-learning or LMS portal URL for this college is evidenced in the TVETA register entry or in this research pass."]', '["none","The TVETA register entry evidences campus-based KNEC craft and diploma programmes only, with no distance or ODeL provision recorded."]', '[true,"Business Management (Craft); Business Management (Diploma); Information Communication Technology (Craft); Information Communication Technology (Diploma); Sales and Marketing (Craft); Sales and Marketing (Diploma); Supply Chain Management (Craft); Supply Chain Management (Diploma)"]', '["Main campus: Mima Center Building, (Donholm) Above Equity Bank, 2nd Floor, Room 16, Nairobi"]', '[]', 'Advent College of Technology is a private technical and vocational college registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018 and located in Nairobi County, Kenya. It is accredited for KNEC examined craft and diploma programmes in business management, information communication technology, sales and marketing and supply chain management.', 'Advent College of Technology is a privately owned technical and vocational college in Nairobi County licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018, registered on 12 April 2018 with a licence valid to 7 March 2029. Its accredited offer is entirely KNEC examined. The register records the same four business-oriented programme areas at both craft and diploma level, giving eight accredited qualifications in total: business management, information communication technology, sales and marketing, and supply chain management. The licence status is recorded as Registered and Licensed. No institution-owned website or published telephone contact for this college was evidenced during this research pass, so those fields are left empty rather than guessed.', '[]', '["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0052/2018, registered 2018-04-12, licence valid to 2029-03-07, status Registered and Licensed","KNEC examination for the accredited craft and diploma programmes"]', '[{"name":"Business Management (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Business Management (Diploma)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology (Diploma)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Sales and Marketing (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Sales and Marketing (Diploma)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Supply Chain Management (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Supply Chain Management (Diplo