"Afiagate Training Centre is a private training centre in Nairobi County, Kenya, registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025 on 25 April 2025 with a licence valid to 24 April 2030. Its single accredited provision is a TVET CDACC level 4 award in community health.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"Afiagate Training Centre, trading publicly as AfiaGate College and also seen online as Afiagate Medical College, is a private TVET institution in Nairobi registered with TVETA as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025. It trains healthcare providers in community health, nursing and caregiving programmes and positions itself as a route to healthcare job markets abroad, including European markets.","locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"stored_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: free-text reworded; canonical narrative kept (reword is not a conflict).","decided_at":"2026-11-21T20:05:16.566531+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"description","settled_at":"2026-11-21T20:05:16.566531+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025","https://www.afiagate.com/","https://www.zoominfo.com/pic/afiagate/1315511536","https://www.facebook.com/Afiagate/videos/922474275933296/"],"stored_value":"Afiagate Training Centre is a private TVET institution recorded in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025, registered on 25 April 2025 with the licence valid to 24 April 2030 and the status Registered and Licensed. The regulator publishes one accredited award, community health at level 4 under the TVET CDACC competency-based curriculum, recorded here at certificate level after normalising the CDACC level. No institution-owned website, social-media page or Google Business Profile was found in this pass, so basic_info.website, e-mail, telephone and logo remain null rather than guessed, and the independent non-registrar source count is zero (no-site: 0 independent sources). No street address, town, enrolment figure, campus list or e-learning portal was confirmed.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"Afiagate Training Centre is a private TVET institution recorded in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025, registered on 25 April 2025 with the licence valid to 24 April 2030 and the status Registered and Licensed. The regulator publishes one accredited award, community health at level 4 under the TVET CDACC competency-based curriculum, normalised here at certificate level. The centre operates from Krishna Center, 7th Floor Suite 700, Westlands, Nairobi, and trades publicly as AfiaGate College, describing itself as a nursing and caregiving education provider with over 500 students and a focus on preparing healthcare providers for job markets abroad, including specialised preparation for European healthcare markets. Its own Facebook video recruitment (''Certified Nurse Assistant at Afiagate training Centre. February Intake ongoing'') confirms active intakes beyond the single TVETA-listed award, and a ZoomInfo profile independently describes accredited certificates and diplomas in community health nursing and healthcare assistance. The institution''s domain www.afiagate.com currently serves unrelated third-party spam content (an apparent domain compromise), so on-site contact details such as e-mail could not be extracted and remain null rather than guessed.","locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"merge","rationale":"Auto-sync: deterministic non-destructive array/course union.","decided_at":"2026-11-21T20:05:16.566539+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"courses","settled_at":"2026-11-21T20:05:16.566539+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025"],"merged_value":[{"name":"Community Health","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Community Health Level 4","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}],"stored_value":[{"name":"Community Health Level 4","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}],"fact_check_url":null,"merge_proposal":[{"name":"Community Health","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Community Health Level 4","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}],"proposed_value":[{"name":"Community Health","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}],"shrinkage_alert":false,"course_merge_stats":{"added":1,"final":2,"initial":1,"removed":0},"locked_by_verification":false}]', 'flagged', null, '93e7bfa524c2', null, null, null, 1, null, 'verification', null, null, 'none', 'verification re-research: website, location, estimated_student_count, campuses (run 93e7bfa524c2)', '2026-11-07 20:17:34.842308+00', 'verification', 1, 1, 0, null, 500, '["none","No institution-owned website or learning-management-system portal was found for the centre."]', '["none","The TVETA register publishes no distance, open or part-time provision and no institution-owned site exists to check."]', '[true,"Community Health (TVET CDACC Level 4); Community Health Nursing (certificate and diploma per ZoomInfo profile); Healthcare Assistance / Certified Nurse Assistant (per the centre''s own Facebook recruitment)"]', '["Krishna Center, 7th Floor Suite 700, Westlands, Nairobi"]', '[]', 'Afiagate Training Centre is a private training centre in Nairobi County, Kenya, registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025 on 25 April 2025 with a licence valid to 24 April 2030. Its single accredited provision is a TVET CDACC level 4 award in community health.', 'Afiagate Training Centre is a private TVET institution recorded in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2025, registered on 25 April 2025 with the licence valid to 24 April 2030 and the status Registered and Licensed. T