","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Ministry","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Business Administration and Management","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Clinical Psychology","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Education","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Inter-Religious Studies","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Leadership and Governance","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Theological Studies","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Translation Studies","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Postgraduate Diploma in Education","level":"Higher Diploma","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Postgraduate Diploma in Theology","level":"Higher Diploma","exam_body":"internal"}],"sources":{"about":["https://www.aiu.ac.ke/mission-vision/","https://www.aiu.ac.ke/schools/"],"courses":["https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"],"facilities":[],"description":["https://www.aiu.ac.ke/contact-us/","https://www.aiu.ac.ke/our-history/","https://odel.aiu.ac.ke"],"accreditations":["https://www.aiu.ac.ke/mission-vision/","https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"]},"facilities":[],"description":"Africa International University states on its mission and vision page that it was founded in 1983 as the Nairobi Evangelical Graduate School of Theology and received a university charter from the Government of Kenya in 2011, and the CUE register carries it under Private Chartered Universities with that 2011 charter year. Its own schools page lists the NEGST School of Theology, the School of Business and Economics, the School of Education, Arts and Social Sciences and the Institute for the Study o