rs with a live learning-management login. The university''s history page reports 2,685 students, 2,956 alumni and 126 staff on its own authority, but no independent enrolment figure, named vice-chancellor contact or official logo file was published on the pages checked, so those fields are left null.', '[]', '["Commission for University Education (CUE) - Private Chartered University, charter granted 2011"]', '[{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Counselling Psychology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Development Studies","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Business Administration","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education (ECD Option)","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education (Primary Option)","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education Secondary option","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Accountancy and Financial Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Theology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Communication, Linguistics and Translation Studies","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Biblical Translation Studies","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Christian Education","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Church History","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Counselling Psychology","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Mission Studies","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Organizational Leadership","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name