o the university''s TVET arm."],"locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"new_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: sourced teaching-courses correction (False -> True).","decided_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396192+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"has_teaching_courses","settled_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396192+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025"],"stored_value":[false,"The accredited table covers hospitality, business, ICT, chaplaincy and ministry, counselling, social work, home care and office assistance awards; no teacher-training programme is recorded."],"fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":[true,"Business Management","Catering and Accommodation Operations","Information Communication Technology","Food and Beverage Operations","Christian Chaplaincy","Counselling Psychology","Social Work","Home Care Management"],"locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"merge","rationale":"Auto-sync: deterministic non-destructive array/course union.","decided_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396201+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"campuses","settled_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396201+00:00","source_urls":["https://maps.google.com/?cid=12302858672577732966","http://www.aiu.ac.ke/"],"merged_value":["Main Campus — Karen, Nairobi, Kenya","Main Campus — Rhino Park Close, Karen, Nairobi, Kenya"],"stored_value":["Main Campus — Karen, Nairobi, Kenya"],"fact_check_url":null,"merge_proposal":["Main Campus — Karen, Nairobi, Kenya","Main Campus — Rhino Park Close, Karen, Nairobi, Kenya"],"proposed_value":["Main Campus — Rhino Park Close, Karen, Nairobi, Kenya"],"locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"stored_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: free-text reworded; canonical narrative kept (reword is not a conflict).","decided_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396209+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"about","settled_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396209+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025"],"stored_value":"Africa International University TVET Institute is the technical and vocational arm of Africa International University in Nairobi County, Kenya, registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025. The register lists twenty-six TVET CDACC competency-based awards from level 3 to level 6 across hospitality, business, ICT, chaplaincy, ministry, counselling, social work and home-care fields.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"Africa International University TVET Institute is the technical and vocational arm of Africa International University in Nairobi County, Kenya, registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025. The register lists twenty-six TVET CDACC competency-based awards from level 3 to level 6 across hospitality, business, ICT, chaplaincy, ministry, counselling, social work and home-care disciplines, delivered from the Rhino Park Close campus in Karen, Nairobi.","locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"stored_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: free-text reworded; canonical narrative kept (reword is not a conflict).","decided_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396215+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"description","settled_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396215+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025","https://maps.google.com/?cid=12302858672577732966","https://odel.aiu.ac.ke/"],"stored_value":"Africa International University TVET Institute is recorded in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025, registered on 29 July 2025 with a licence valid to 28 July 2030 under the status Registered and Licensed. The register places it in Nairobi County and classifies it as a private technical and vocational college, and its registered name identifies it as the TVET institute of Africa International University. Twenty-six accredited course rows are listed, all examined by TVET CDACC: eight at level 5, four at level 3, seven at level 4 and seven at level 6, covering hospitality and catering, business management, information communication technology, Christian ministry and chaplaincy, counselling psychology, social work, home care management, Kenyan Sign Language and office assistance. Register levels were normalised to the schema vocabulary, with CDACC levels 3 and 4 rendered as Artisan, level 5 as Certificate and level 6 as Diploma. The university publishes an ODeL directorate and online learning provision, so the learning modes are recorded as implied, but no TVET-institute-specific portal URL could be fetched in this pass and no verified student count, email address or named administrator was available.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"Africa International University TVET Institute is recorded in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025, registered on 29 July 2025 with a licence valid to 28 July 2030 under the status Registered and Licensed. The register places it in Nairobi County and classifies it as a private technical and vocational college, and its registered name identifies it as the TVET institute of Africa International University. Twenty-six accredited course rows are listed, all examined by TVET CDACC: eight at level 5, four at level 3, seven at level 4 and seven at level 6, covering hospitality and catering, business management, information communication technology, chaplaincy and ministry, counselling psychology, social work, home care and office assistance. The institute operates from Africa International University''s campus at Rhino Park Close in Karen, Nairobi, and shares the university''s library, ICT services, health services, cafeteria and student housing, and its Moodle-based Open, Distance and e-Learning portal, which carries a dedicated TIVET, Professional and Short course category.","locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"merge","rationale":"Auto-sync: deterministic non-destructive array/course union.","decided_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396222+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"courses","settled_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:39.396222+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025"],"merged_value":[{"name":"Business Management","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Catering and Accommodation Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Christian Chaplaincy","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Christian Ministry","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Counselling psychology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Food and Beverage Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Social Work","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Baking","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Computer Operations","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Food and Beverage (Cookery)","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Home Care Management","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Accommodation Operations","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Baking Level 4","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Food and Beverage Production (Cookery)","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Food and Beverage Sales and Service","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology Level 4","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Kenyan Sign Language","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Office Assistant","level":"Artisan"