tional University Open, Distance and e-Learning portal at https://odel.aiu.ac.ke/ is live on Moodle and states ''Learning doesn''t have to stop because of distance. Selected AIU programmes bring the learning to you — wherever you are.'' It carries a ''TIVET, Professional & Short'' course category, so distance delivery extends to the university''s TVET arm."]', '[true,"Business Management; Catering and Accommodation Operations; Information Communication Technology; Food and Beverage Operations; Christian Chaplaincy; Counselling Psychology; Social Work; Home Care Management"]', '["Main Campus — Karen, Nairobi, Kenya","Main Campus — Rhino Park Close, Karen, Nairobi, Kenya"]', '["Africa International University"]', 'Africa International University TVET Institute is the technical and vocational arm of Africa International University in Nairobi County, Kenya, registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025. The register lists twenty-six TVET CDACC competency-based awards from level 3 to level 6 across hospitality, business, ICT, chaplaincy, ministry, counselling, social work and home-care fields.', 'Africa International University TVET Institute is recorded in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025, registered on 29 July 2025 with a licence valid to 28 July 2030 under the status Registered and Licensed. The register places it in Nairobi County and classifies it as a private technical and vocational college, and its registered name identifies it as the TVET institute of Africa International University. Twenty-six accredited course rows are listed, all examined by TVET CDACC: eight at level 5, four at level 3, seven at level 4 and seven at level 6, covering hospitality and catering, business management, information communication technology, Christian ministry and chaplaincy, counselling psychology, social work, home care management, Kenyan Sign Language and office assistance. Register levels were normalised to the schema vocabulary, with CDACC levels 3 and 4 rendered as Artisan, level 5 as Certificate and level 6 as Diploma. The university publishes an ODeL directorate and online learning provision, so the learning modes are recorded as implied, but no TVET-institute-specific portal URL could be fetched in this pass and no verified student count, email address or named administrator was available.', '["Library","ICT services","Health services","Cafeteria and student housing","Conference facilities","Sports facilities","Moodle-based ODeL e-learning portal"]', '["Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority (TVETA) registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0127/2025, registered 2025-07-29, licence valid to 2030-07-28, status ''Registered and Licensed''","TVET Curriculum Development, Assessment and Certification Council (CDACC) - examining body for all twenty-six level 3 to level 6 competency-based awards"]', '[{"name":"Business Management","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Catering and Accommodation Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Christian Chaplaincy","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Christian Ministry","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Counselling psychology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Food and Beverage Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Social Work","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Baking","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Computer Operations","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Food and Beverage (Cookery)","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Home Care Management","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Accommodation Operations","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC