helor of Arts in Community Development","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Criminal Justice and Security Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Peace and Conflict Resolution","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Counselling Psychology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Business and Information Technology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Commerce","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Commerce in Human Resource Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education in Early Childhood Education","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education in Primary Education","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education in Secondary Education","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Laws","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Mass Communication","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Computer Science","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Dryland Natural Resource Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Environmental Resource Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in International Business Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Procurement and Supply Chain Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Theology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Counselling Psychology","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Monitoring and Evaluation","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Religion","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Business Administration","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Education (Administration)","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Science in Applied Information Technology","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Science in Environmental and Natural Resource Management","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Science in Governance, Peace and Security","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Ministry","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Business Administration and Management","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Religion","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Postgraduate Diploma in Monitoring and Evaluation","level":"Higher Diploma","exam_body":"internal"}],"sources":{"about":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/about-anu/main-campus/","https://www.anu.ac.ke/"],"courses":["https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"],"facilities":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/about-anu/main-campus/"],"description":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/","https://www.anu.ac.ke/?anu_online=about-anu-online","https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/"],"accreditations":["https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"]},"facilities":["Over 50 modern lecture halls","Grace Roles library facility","On-campus student accommodation","Two dining areas","Gym and sports facilities","University shop and ample parking"],"description":"The CUE register lists Africa Nazarene University under Private Chartered Universities with a 2002 charter year, and the CUE accredited programme register of 31 July 2026 carries thirty-one ANU awards: nineteen bachelor''s degrees, eight master''s degrees, three doctorates and a postgraduate diploma in monitoring and evaluation. The university''s main campus page describes a 124-acre site next to the Nairobi National Park, off Magadi Road near Ongata Rongai, and lists over fifty lecture halls, the Grace Roles library, accommodation, dining areas and sports facilities. Its contact page publishes marketing@anu.ac.ke, vc@anu.ac.ke, complaints@anu.ac.ke and admissions@anu.ac.ke with the numbers +254 703 970 520 and +254 20 252 7173/4, and its ANU Online page states that all programmes from certificate to doctorate are offered fully online through the eNaz virtual learning environment, with the ANU Online portal answering at https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/. The record keeps the university''s own campus town of Ongata Rongai under Kajiado County and the Rift Valley region, and leaves logo_url, estimated_student_count and personal_contacts null because no official logo file, independently verified enrolment figure or named officer with a published direct contact was found on the pages checked. Only the main campus is recorded here; the additional city, Meru, Eldoret and Machakos study centres that appear in inherited data could not be confirmed from the university''s own pages in this pass.","accreditations":["Commission for University Education (CUE) - Private Chartered University, charter year 2002 as recorded in the CUE register"]},"basic_info":{"email":"marketing@anu.ac.ke","phone":"+254 773 977 859","sources":{"email":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"],"phone":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"],"website":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/"],"location":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/about-anu/main-campus/"],"logo_url":[]},"website":"https://www.anu.ac.ke","location":{"town":"Ongata Rongai","county":"Kajiado County","region":"Rift Valley","location":"Main Campus, off Magadi Road next to Nairobi National Park, Ongata Rongai"},"logo_url":null},"personal_contacts":[],"institution_profile":{"type":"UNIVERSITY","sources":{"campuses":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/","https://www.anu.ac.ke/about-anu/main-campus/"],"category":[],"ownership":["https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"],"affiliation":[],"has_elearning":["https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/"],"has_teaching_courses":["https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"],"has_distance_learning":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/?anu_online=about-anu-online"],"estimated_student_count":[]},"campuses":["Main Campus, Ongata Rongai (off Magadi Road, next to Nairobi National Park)"],"category":null,"ownership":"private","affiliation":[],"has_elearning":["verified","https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/ answers as the Africa Nazarene University Online portal, and the university documents the eNaz learning-management platform on its ANU Online page."],"has_teaching_courses":[true,"Bachelor of Laws","Bachelor of Commerce","Doctor of Philosophy in Religion"],"has_distance_learning":["verified","The university states that all its programmes, including doctorate, masters, undergraduate, diploma and certificate awards, are offered through ANU Online and the eNaz virtual learning environment, described at https://www.anu.ac.ke/?anu_online=about-anu-online."],"estimated_student_count":null}}', '{"basic_info.email":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"The contact page''s ''Get in Touch'' block prints ''EMAIL ADDRESS: marketing@anu.ac.ke / vc@anu.ac.ke'' and the intake banner prints ''admissions@anu.ac.ke / marketing@anu.ac.ke'' - the stored address is published verbatim by the university itself.","url_checked":"https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"},"basic_info.phone":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"The contact page header prints ''Call us: +254 773 977 859'' as a tel: link, identical to the stored number (the page also prints +254 709 221 400 and +254 703 970 520, so the stored line is one of the university''s published numbers).","url_checked":"https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"},"basic_info.website":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"https://www.anu.ac.ke resolves to the university''s own site (site logo links to anu.ac.ke, Contact Us, Main Campus, ANU Online and admissions sections under the same host), so the stored domain is the institution''s own.","url_checked":"https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"},"basic_info.location":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"The stored premises and town are the university''s main campus off Magadi Road beside the Nairobi National Park at Ongata Rongai; the contact page sits under the Main Campus menu and the campus page is the cited source. Kajiado County is the county in which Ongata Rongai lies (Rift Valley region), consistent with the stored county/region pair.","url_checked":"https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"},"institution_profile.has_elearning":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"The stored ''verified'' status rests on a live LMS host; https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/ responds as the university''s own online-learning portal (title ''AFRICA NAZARENE UNIVERSITY ONLINE''), so the verified status is supported rather than downgraded.","url_checked":"https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/"},"institution_profile.has_distance_learning":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"Stored status is ''verified'' on the strength of ANU Online. The live portal https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/ answers with the title ''AFRICA NAZARENE UNIVERSITY ONLINE'' and a consent/registration form, and the ANU Online menu (About ANU Online, Programs on ANU Online) is reachable from the main site, so a real online/distance provision exists.","url_checked":"https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/"}}', '{"email":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"],"phone":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/"],"website":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/"],"campuses":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/contact-us/","https://www.anu.ac.ke/about-anu/main-campus/"],"category":[],"location":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/about-anu/main-campus/"],"logo_url":[],"ownership":["https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"],"affiliation":[],"has_elearning":["https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/"],"has_teaching_courses":["https://www.cue.or.ke/images/2026/Programme_Accreditation/Accredited_Academic_Programmes_31.07.2026.pdf"],"has_distance_learning":["https://www.anu.ac.ke/?anu_online=about-anu-online"],"estimated_student_count":[]}', 80, 'researched', '2026-10-24 09:16:03.56084+00', '2026-11-20 17:55:31.495077+00', 'not_applied', '2026-10-25 06:29:54.897836+00', null, '[]', 'unverified', null, null, null, null, null, 0, null, 'verification', null, null, 'enriched', 'Requeued to re_research afresh under the new process', null, 're_research', 1, 0, 0, null, null, '["verified","https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/ answers as the Africa Nazarene University Online portal, and the university documents the eNaz learning-management platform on its ANU Online page."]', '["verified","The university states that all its programmes, including doctorate, masters, undergraduate, diploma and certificate awards, are offered through ANU Online and the eNaz virtual learning environment, described at https://www.anu.ac.ke/?anu_online=about-anu-online."]', '[true,"Bachelor of Laws","Bachelor of Commerce","Doctor of Philosophy in Religion"]', '["Main Campus, Ongata Rongai (off Magadi Road, next to Nairobi National Park)"]', '[]', 'Africa Nazarene University (ANU) is a private chartered university whose main campus occupies 124 acres beside the Nairobi National Park, off Magadi Road near Ongata Rongai town, about 24 km from Nairobi city centre. It teaches theology, business, law, education, communication, computing and environmental programmes on campus and through its ANU Online platform.', 'The CUE register lists Africa Nazarene University under Private Chartered Universities with a 2002 charter year, and the CUE accredited programme register of 31 July 2026 carries thirty-one ANU awards: nineteen bachelor''s degrees, eight master''s degrees, three doctorates and a postgraduate diploma in monitoring and evaluation. The university''s main campus page describes a 124-acre site next to the Nairobi National Park, off Magadi Road near Ongata Rongai, and lists over fifty lecture halls, the Grace Roles library, accommodation, dining areas and sports facilities. Its contact page publishes marketing@anu.ac.ke, vc@anu.ac.ke, complaints@anu.ac.ke and admissions@anu.ac.ke with the numbers +254 703 970 520 and +254 20 252 7173/4, and its ANU Online page states that all programmes from certificate to doctorate are offered fully online through the eNaz virtual learning environment, with the ANU Online portal answering at https://anuonline.anu.ac.ke/. The record keeps the university''s own campus town of Ongata Rongai under Kajiado County and the Rift Valley region, and leaves logo_url, estimated_student_count and personal_contacts null because no official logo file, independently verified enrolment figure or named officer with a published direct contact was found on the pages checked. Only the main campus is recorded here; the additional city, Meru, Eldoret and Machakos study centres that appear in inherited data could not be confirmed from the university''s own pages in this pass.', '["Over 50 modern lecture halls","Grace Roles library facility","On-campus student accommodation","Two dining areas","Gym and sports facilities","University shop and ample parking"]', '["Commission for University Education (CUE) - Private Chartered University, charter year 2002 as recorded in the CUE register"]', '[{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Christian Ministry","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Community Development","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Criminal Justice and Security Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Peace and Conflict Resolution","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Arts in Counselling Psychology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Business and Information Technology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Commerce","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Commerce in Human Resource Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education in Early Childhood Education","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education in Primary Education","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Education in Secondary Education","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Laws","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Mass Communication","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Computer Science","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Dryland Natural Resource Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Environmental Resource Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in International Business Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Science in Procurement and Supply Chain Management","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Bachelor of Theology","level":"Degree","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Counselling Psychology","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Monitoring and Evaluation","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Arts in Religion","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Business Administration","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Education (Administration)","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Science in Applied Information Technology","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Science in Environmental and Natural Resource Management","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Master of Science in Governance, Peace and Security","level":"Masters","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Ministry","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Business Administration and Management","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Doctor of Philosophy in Religion","level":"PhD","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Postgraduate Diploma in Monitoring and Evaluation","level":"Higher Diploma","exam_body":"internal"}]', '[]', 78, '{}', '[]', null, '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'pending', null, null, null);
insert into "institutions" ("id", "name", "type", "category", "ownership", "operational_status", "website", "email", "phone", "logo_url", "location", "town", "county", "region", "research_data", "validation", "sources", "research_score", "research_status", "created_at", "updated_at", "sync_status", "sync_updated_at", "sync_run_id", "conflict", "verification_status", "verified_at", "verified_by_run", "claimed_by", "claimed_until", "claim_queue", "attempt_count", "last_error", "last_writer", "duplicate_of", "registration_status", "profile_level", "research_note", "research_queued_at", "research_origin", "research_pass", "verification_pass", "conflict_pass", "verification_basis", "estimated_student_count", "has_elearning", "has_distance_learning", "has_teaching_courses", "campuses", "affiliation", "about", "description", "facilities", "accreditations", "courses", "personal_contacts", "health_score", "verified_fields_jsonb", "changelog_jsonb", "last_sync_at", "target_fields", "social_media", "corpus_sources", "institution_sources", "other_sources", "geo", "prefetch_status", "evidence_prefetched_at", "evidence_packaged_at", "prefetch_error") overriding system value values ('1eae16e2-9bf0-4e7d-ba74-f77b1f0245c8', 'Africa Theological Seminary', 'TVET', 'TVC', 'private', 'active', 'https://www.atseminary.ac.ke', 'info@atseminary.ac.ke', '+254718901429', 'https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/images/goodlogo.gif', 'Waterworks Road, Section Six Estate, Kitale (P.O. Box 1284-30200, Kitale)', 'Kitale', 'Trans Nzoia County', 'Rift Valley', '{"context":{"about":"Africa Theological Seminary (ATS) is a private, non-denominational post-secondary institution on a 20-acre campus in Section Six Estate, Kitale, Trans Nzoia County, registered with the TVET Authority (TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016) and operating under its parent organization International Christian Ministries on a semi-residential in-service model to train pastors, counsellors and Christian leaders already serving in ministry.","courses":[{"name":"Information Communication Technology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Social Development","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Counselling","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Christian Chaplaincy","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Christian Ministry","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Counselling psychology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Christian Ministry","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Counselling Psychology","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Theology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Theology","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}],"sources":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016","https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/about.html","https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/study.html","https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/facilities.html","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-africa-theological-seminary"],"facilities":["20-acre self-owned campus with permanent buildings","Two furnished office blocks with 24-hour internet access","Four lecture rooms","Library with over 30,000 study and research materials","Textbook centre","Computer laboratory with over 10 internet-connected computers","Prayer tower for private prayer and meditation","Dining hall and kitchen","Student dormitories and hostels","Guest houses for visiting faculty, speakers and church leaders","Carpentry workshop producing furniture on order","Canteen and bookstore","Chapel hall for worship and large gatherings","Own water borehole","24-hour automatic standby generator","Football field and volleyball court"],"description":"Africa Theological Seminary grew out of International Christian Ministries (ICM), which began teaching seminars in Kenya in 1986 and launched a degree programme in 1993; the name Africa Theological Seminary was given to the semi-residential programmes at the Kitale training centre in 2008. The seminary is registered as a post-secondary institution by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016, and most of its study programmes are accredited by the Association for Christian Theological Education in Africa (ACTEA). Its TVETA course table lists KNEC craft certificates in Information Communication Technology and Social Development, a KNEC diploma in Counselling, and TVET CDACC Level 5 certificates and Level 6 diplomas in Christian Chaplaincy, Christian Ministry and Counselling Psychology, while the seminary''s own study page lists Theology and Counseling programmes at certificate and diploma level. ATS trains leaders ''in ministry'' rather than ''for ministry'': all programmes run on an in-service model built around block courses so students can continue serving in their primary ministries while studying. The institution sits on 20 acres of self-owned land on Waterworks Road in Section Six Estate, about 1.5 km from Kitale town''s central business district, with dormitories, a 30,000-item library, a computer laboratory and a chapel hall on site.","accreditations":["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016 (Registered and Licensed)","KNEC examination body for craft certificate and diploma courses","TVET CDACC examination body for Level 5 and Level 6 programmes","Association for Christian Theological Education in Africa (ACTEA) accreditation of most study programmes"]},"basic_info":{"email":"info@atseminary.ac.ke","phone":"+254718901429","sources":["https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/about.html","https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/study.html","https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016"],"website":"https://www.atseminary.ac.ke","location":{"town":"Kitale","county":"Trans Nzoia County","region":"Rift Valley","location":"Waterworks Road, Section Six Estate, Kitale (P.O. Box 1284-30200, Kitale)"},"logo_url":"https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/images/goodlogo.gif"},"personal_contacts":[],"institution_profile":{"type":"TVET","sources":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016","https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/about.html","https://www.atseminary.ac.ke/study.html"],"campuses":null,"category":"TVC","ownership":"private","affiliation":["International Christian Ministries (ICM)"],"has_elearning":["none","No LMS, moodle or e-learning portal URL appears on the seminary website; the only portal link (atseminary.ac.ke/webmail) is a staff email login, and the TVETA record lists no virtual-learning platform."],"has_teaching_courses":[true,["Diploma in Theology","Certificate in Christian Ministry","Diploma in Counseling","Certificate in Counseling","Information Communication Technology","Christian Chaplaincy","Counselling Psychology"]],"has_distance_learning":["none","No distance-learning or ODeL provision is published on the TVETA record or the seminary website; ATS teaches through a semi-residential in-service block model where students attend on-campus residential sessions in Kitale."],"estimated_student_count":null}}', '{"field_verdicts":{"town":{"status":"confirmed","verdict":"confirmed","rationale":"town (''Kitale'') corroborated in cached evidence.","source_url":"https://maps.google.com/?cid=10511149753126124044&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA","url_checked":"https://maps.google.com/?cid=10511149753126124044&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA","evidence_key":"institutions/1eae16e2-9bf0-4e7d-ba74-f77b1f0245c8/20261119T214431Z-gcp-places.txt"},"type":{"status":"confirmed","verdict":"confirmed","rationale":"TVETA corpus entry TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016 confirms TVET institution.","source_url":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0165/2016"},"about":{"status":"confirmed","