 dietetics, agripreneurship and community health.","courses":[{"name":"Social Development","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Social Work and Community Development","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Nutrition and Dietetics","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Nutrition and Dietetics","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Agripreneurship Level 4","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Agripreneurship Level 5","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Community Health Level 5","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}],"sources":{"about":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024","https://airads.ac.ke/contact/"],"courses":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024"],"description":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024","https://airads.ac.ke/contact/","https://www.facebook.com/people/Airads-college-maralal/61551590921513/"],"accreditations":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024"]},"facilities":null,"description":"African Institute of Research and Development Studies Maralal is a private technical and vocational college registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority on 29 October 2024 under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024, with a licence valid to 28 October 2029 in ''Registered and Licensed'' status; the regulator records its category as TVC and its county as Samburu. The campus trades as Maralal Town Campus and sits in the Supa Sacco Building, 2nd Floor, opposite Huduma Centre in Maralal town, sharing the group head-office contacts at info@airads.ac.ke and the campus line 0717 885 888. The TVETA accredited course table lists eight qualifications: KNEC craft programmes in social development, information communication technology and nutrition and dietetics; KNEC diplomas in social work and community development and in nutrition and dietetics; and TVET CDACC competency-based programmes in agripreneurship (Levels 4 and 5) and community health (Level 5). The campus is part of the AIRADS College chain, which also operates campuses in Eldoret, Nakuru, Kisumu, Kericho, Bungoma, Lodwar and Nairobi under the website www.airads.ac.ke, and its students use the group student portal at portal.airads.ac.ke. Its Facebook presence (''Airads college maralal'', about 672 likes, and ''Airads College Maralal Campus'') advertises professional short courses, computer packages, diploma, certificate and artisan programmes to the Maralal community.","accreditations":["TVETA registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024, registered 2024-10-29, licence valid to 2029-10-28, status ''Registered and Licensed''","KNEC examination for the craft and diploma programmes","TVET CDACC assessment for the Level 4 and Level 5 competency-based programmes"]},"basic_info":{"email":"info@airads.ac.ke","phone":"+254717885888","sources":{"email":["https://airads.ac.ke/contact/"],"phone":["https://airads.ac.ke/contact/"],"website":["https://www.airads.ac.ke/","https://airads.ac.ke/contact/","https://maps.google.com/?cid=18386355539622298697&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA"],"logo_url":["https://airads.ac.ke/contact/"],"location.town":["https://airads.ac.ke/contact/","https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024"],"location.county":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024"],"location.region":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0137/2024"],"location.location":["https://airads.ac.ke/contact/","https://www.facebook.com/61551590921513/posts/welcome-to-airads-maralal-campus-we-are-located-at-supa-sacco-opposite-huduma-ce/122099105372053030/"]},"website":"htt