dy":"KNEC"},{"name":"Sales and Marketing","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Social Development","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Supply Chain Management","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Tour Guiding Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Business Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Human Resource Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Sales and Marketing","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Social Work and Community Development","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Supply Chain Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Tourism Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Accounting Technicians Diploma","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KASNEB"}]', '[]', 74, '{}', '[{"field":"website","action":"gap_sync","new_val":"https://www.airads.ac.ke/","old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:48:55.894593+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_655ef434"},{"field":"email","action":"gap_sync","new_val":"info@airads.ac.ke","old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:48:55.894593+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_655ef434"},{"field":"has_elearning","action":"new_wins","new_val":["verified","Live Virtual Campus e-learning platform at https://virtual.airads.ac.ke/ offering self-paced online courses and Google Meet classes, linked from https://airads.ac.ke/."],"old_val":["none","No institutional website or learning-management-system portal is published for the college."],"rationale":"Confirmed first-hand by rendering https://virtual.airads.ac.ke/ on 2026-11-17: the host serves ''AIRADS Virtual Campus - Learn Anytime, Anywhere With ... Self-paced online courses with dedicated trainers and 20 years of excellence'', with category-filtered course catalogues, lecture counts, durations, prices and a linked student portal (portal.airads.ac.ke). That is a live institutional LMS, so ''verified'' is sourced. D4 affiliate note: the portal is the AIRADS network''s platform serving its separately registered campuses, this Kisumu row included - an affiliated site, kept, not a wrong-entity value.","timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:48:55.894593+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_655ef434","source_urls":["https://virtual.airads.ac.ke/","https://www.airads.ac.ke/contact/"]},{"field":"has_distance_learning","action":"new_wins","new_val":["verified","AIRADS Virtual Campus at https://virtual.airads.ac.ke/ delivers flexible online certificate, diploma and artisan programmes."],"old_val":["none","No institutional website or distance-learning page is published or referenced on the regulator register entry or the fetched listing."],"rationale":"Same rendered fetch: the AIRADS Virtual Campus delivers flexible self-paced online artisan, certificate, diploma and short-course study away from campus, which is ODeL provision and not an implication. The network contact page also lists the Kisumu campus separately, so the online arm is a real delivery channel for this registrant rather than a marketing line.","timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:48:55.894593+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_655ef434","source_urls":["https://virtual.airads.ac.ke/","https://www.airads.ac.ke/contact/"]}]', '2026-11-17 00:48:55.882128+00', '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'packaged', '2026-11-22 12:30:52.865572+00', '2026-11-22 12:30:52.865572+00', null);
