p private, category TVC. KUCCPS live members list (kuccps.net/kuccps-registered-members, fetched 2026-11-17) lists ''African Institute of Research and Development Studies'' under Private Colleges — independent regulator corroboration (noted as lead; not used as a cited host here to avoid inflating host count).","verified_at":"2026-11-17T01:49:19.654149+00:00"},"description":{"run_id":"t_1b593cf0-b24-r1","status":"confirmed","rationale":"Same register row substantiates the description (reg no, dates, course table, null identity fields).","verified_at":"2026-11-17T01:49:19.654149+00:00"},"has_elearning":{"run_id":"t_1b593cf0-b24-r1","status":"confirmed","rationale":"Register entry publishes no portal address; no institutional e-learning portal found on fetched live pages. LEAD: portal.airads.ac.ke student portal exists — route via research/sync.","verified_at":"2026-11-17T01:49:19.654149+00:00"},"accreditations":{"run_id":"t_1b593cf0-b24-r1","status":"confirmed","rationale":"Register row TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2017 (registered 2017-04-12, expiry 2029-07-02, status Registered and Licensed) confirmed in the local migrated TVETA corpus, which is the current register state. No contradicting evidence; live register not refetched (local corpus is current).","verified_at":"2026-11-17T01:49:19.654149+00:00"},"has_teaching_courses":{"run_id":"t_1b593cf0-b24-r1","status":"confirmed","rationale":"Register course table lists no teacher-training programme (business/ICT/social development/tourism only).","verified_at":"2026-11-17T01:49:19.654149+00:00"},"has_distance_learning":{"run_id":"t_1b593cf0-b24-r1","status":"confirmed","rationale":"Register entry records no distance-learning provision; no portal found on the live site. Negative register-based claim stands. LEAD (rationale only): live institution publishes a Student Portal at https://portal.airads.ac.ke (LMS-adjacent) — new-fact lead for research/sync, not verified here.","verified_at":"2026-11-17T01:49:19.654149+00:00"}}', '[{"field":"location","action":"gap_sync","new_val":"Nakuru","old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"town","action":"gap_sync","new_val":"Nakuru","old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"has_elearning","action":"gap_sync","new_val":["none","No institutional e-learning portal was found for this campus; the register entry publishes no portal address."],"old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"has_distance_learning","action":"gap_sync","new_val":["none","The TVETA register entry records no distance-learning provision and no distance-learning portal was verified for this campus."],"old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"has_teaching_courses","action":"gap_sync","new_val":[false,"The TVETA-approved course table for this campus lists business, ICT, social-development and tourism awards; no teacher-training programme is registered."],"old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"about","action":"gap_sync","new_val":"The African Institute of Research and Development Studies Nakuru campus is a private technical and vocational college registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority under number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2017, recorded as Registered and Licensed with a licence expiry date of 2 July 2029. Its approved portfolio spans certificate and diploma awards in business, ICT, information studies, social development and tourism examined by the Kenya National Examinations Council.","old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"description","action":"gap_sync","new_val":"The African Institute of Research and Development Studies Nakuru campus appears in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as a private TVC in Nakuru County under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2017, registered on 12 April 2017 and recorded as Registered and Licensed with a licence expiry date of 2 July 2029. The register''s course table carries eleven distinct awards after de-duplication on course, level and examining body: five craft awards (human resource management, information communication technology, information studies, social development, and tour guiding and travel operations) and six diploma awards (dietetics management, human resource management, information communication technology, information studies, social work and community development, and tourism management), all examined by the Kenya National Examinations Council. Level normalisation follows the convention used across this research programme: KNEC craft awards are recorded at schema level Certificate and KNEC diploma awards at Diploma, with the examining body preserved exactly as printed in the register. The register publishes no institutional website, e-mail address or telephone number for this campus, so the e-mail and identity fields are left null rather than filled with a plausible-looking placeholder, and the campus site''s own contact lines are not attributable to the Nakuru campus specifically.","old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"accreditations","action":"gap_sync","new_val":["Registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority (TVETA) under registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2017, registration date 12 April 2017, expiry date 2 July 2029, status Registered and Licensed"],"old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"},{"field":"courses","action":"gap_sync","new_val":[{"name":"Human Resource Management","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Studies","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Social Development","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Tour Guiding and Travel Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Dietetics Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Human Resource Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Studies","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Social Work and Community Development","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Tourism Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"}],"old_val":null,"timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:01:47.121425+00:00","decided_by":"agent:t_68c25aa3"}]', '2026-11-17 00:01:47.10569+00', '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'pending', null, null, null);
