tus":"confirmed","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/accredited-tvet-institutions"},"institution_profile.category":{"notes":"Register category TVC matches stored TVC.","status":"confirmed","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/accredited-tvet-institutions"},"institution_profile.ownership":{"notes":"Register ownership private matches stored private.","status":"confirmed","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/accredited-tvet-institutions"}}', '{"type":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023","email":"https://aitec.ac.ke/","phone":"https://aitec.ac.ke/","website":"https://aitec.ac.ke/","category":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023","location":"https://aitec.ac.ke/","logo_url":"https://aitec.ac.ke/","ownership":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023","has_elearning":"https://aitec.ac.ke/","location.town":"https://aitec.ac.ke/","location.county":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023","location.region":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023","has_teaching_courses":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023","has_distance_learning":"https://aitec.ac.ke/"}', 68, 'researched', '2026-10-24 09:16:03.56084+00', '2026-11-22 14:58:13.239239+00', 'not_applied', '2026-10-27 00:48:16.548127+00', 't_a22ebb1b-3459ec52', '[]', 'unverified', null, null, null, null, null, 0, null, 'verification', null, null, 'enriched', 'Requeued to re_research afresh under the new process', null, 're_research', 1, 0, 0, null, null, '["none","No e-learning portal or learning-management-system URL is published on aitec.ac.ke."]', '["none","No distance-learning or ODeL provision is published on aitec.ac.ke, which presents campus-based programmes at Mogotio."]', '[false]', '[]', '[]', 'African International Training Institute trades as African International Technical College (AITEC), a private technical college at Mogotio in Baringo County, Rift Valley region, Kenya, registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023. It offers KNEC craft and diploma programmes in health, agriculture, technology and engineering fields plus TVET CDACC Level 4, Level 5 and Level 6 competency-based programmes in cosmetology, caregiving, community health, healthcare support and perioperative theatre technology.', 'African International Training Institute appears in the TVET Authority register as African International Technical College, a private Technical and Vocational College in Baringo County, Rift Valley region, registration number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023, registered on 31 July 2023 and licensed to 30 July 2028 in ''Registered and Licensed'' status; the college trades as AITEC on its own website and both names are recorded here rather than overwriting either. The regulator''s course table carries twenty-three rows which deduplicate to twenty-one qualifications: five KNEC craft awards, eight KNEC diplomas spanning building, civil, electrical, fashion, agriculture, human resource management, ICT and social work, and TVET CDACC competency-based programmes at Level 4 in cosmetology and caregiving, Level 5 in cosmetology, community health, healthcare support services and perioperative theatre technology, and Level 6 in community health and perioperative theatre technology. Craft awards are mapped to Certificate, diplomas to Diploma, CDACC Level 4 to Artisan and Levels 5 and 6 to Certificate and Diploma respectively. The college''s own site describes it as a technical institution for health, agriculture, technology and engineering, places it at Mogotio 38 kilometres north of Nakuru City with a P.O. Box 12938 Nakuru address, and publishes the telephone lines 0715 244974, 0726 854256, 0741 121599 and 0706 278051 together with the address aitec.mogotio@gmail.com. No student population figure, distance-learning provision or e-learning portal is published, so those remain unverified.', '[]', '["Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority (TVETA) - status Registered and Licensed, reference TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0075/2023, registered 2023-07-31, licence valid to 2028-07-30","Kenya National Examinations Council (KNEC) - examination body for the craft and diploma programmes, per the TVETA accredited course table","TVET Curriculum Development, Assessment and Certification Council (CDACC) - assessment and certification for the Level 4, Level 5 and Level 6 programmes, per the TVETA accredited course table"]', '[{"name":"Food and Beverage Production and Service (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Studies (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Nutrition and Dietetics (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Supply Chain Management (Craft)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Building Technology","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Civil Engineering","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Electrical and Electronics Engineering (Power)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Fashion Design and Clothing Technology","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Agriculture","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Human Resource Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Information Communication Technology (Diploma)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Social Work and Community Development","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Cosmetology Level 4","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Caregiving Level 4","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Cosmetology Level 5","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Community Health Level 5","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Healthcare Support Services Level 5","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Perioperative Theatre Technology Level 5","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Community Health Level 6","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Perioperative Theatre Technology Level 6","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"}]', '[]', 67, '{}', '[]', null, '', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{}', 'packaged', '2026-11-22 14:58:13.239239+00', '2026-11-22 14:58:13.239239+00', null);
