g for Managers Course","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Flour Quality and Baking Course","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Feed Milling Technology I","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Feed Milling for Executives","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Apprentice Feed Miller Program","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Coffee Handling and Roasting","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Coffee Processing Basics","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Mechanical Maintenance","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Electrical Maintenance","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Programmable Logic Control (PLC) and Automation Maintenance","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Baking Technology","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Lab Analytics","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Introduction to Milling","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Silo Management","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Mycotoxins","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"},{"name":"Brewing: Barley to Wort","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"internal"}],"sources":{"about":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html","courses":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/","facilities":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/training/feed-miller-course.html","description":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/","accreditations":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016"},"facilities":["Classrooms","Maintenance workshop","Analytics laboratory","Fully equipped school mill"],"description":"The African Milling School is a certificated vocational school established in 2015 by the Buhler Group, sitting at the corner of Thika Road and the Eastern Bypass in Ruiru, Kiambu County, and registered and licensed by TVETA as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016 with a licence current to 24 November 2026. It trains millers, maintenance technicians, quality controllers and operations managers for the flour, feed, coffee and baking industries, and publishes more than 1,625 graduates across 135 classes and trainees from over thirty countries. The flagship programmes are a one-year Head Miller Program, a two-year Apprentice Miller Program delivered with the Swiss School of Milling, and the Milling for Managers course, supported by short courses in flour quality and baking, feed milling, coffee handling and roasting, mechanical and electrical maintenance, PLC and automation, laboratory analytics, silo management and mycotoxins. The school publishes classrooms, a maintenance workshop, an analytics laboratory and a fully equipped school mill, and gives its address and course-coordinator contact as ams.nairobi@buhlergroup.com and +254 793 262 506, with Kipyegon Korir named as course coordinator on the Buhler location page. Neither the school pages nor the Buhler page publish qualification levels in the schema vocabulary, so programmes are recorded at the nearest level (the two-year apprenticeship as a diploma, workshops and short courses as certificates).","accreditations":["Registered and licensed by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority (TVETA) as TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016, licence expiry 2026-11-24, status Registered and Licensed"]},"basic_info":{"email":"ams.nairobi@buhlergroup.com","phone":"+254 793 262 506","sources":{"town":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html","email":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html","phone":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html","county":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016","region":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016","website":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/","location":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html"},"website":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/","location":{"town":"Ruiru","county":"Kiambu County","region":"Central","location":"Corner of Thika Road & Eastern Bypass, Ruiru"},"logo_url":null},"personal_contacts":[{"email":"ams.nairobi@buhlergroup.com","phone":"+254 793 262 506","source":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html","job_title":"Course Coordinator","contact_name":"Kipyegon Korir","profile_summary":"Listed as the African Milling School course coordinator on Buhler''s official location page for the school, which carries the school''s address and contact line."}],"institution_profile":{"type":"TVET","sources":{"type":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016","campuses":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html","category":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016","ownership":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016","affiliation":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html","has_elearning":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/","has_teaching_courses":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/","has_distance_learning":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/"},"category":"TVC","ownership":"private","affiliation":[],"has_elearning":["none","Virtual courses are advertised, but no learning-management-system or course-delivery portal URL is published on the school or Buhler pages fetched."],"has_teaching_courses":[false,"Provision is milling, feed, coffee and maintenance training for industry; no teacher-training qualification is advertised."],"has_distance_learning":["implied","The school advertises virtual and hybrid delivery for several courses, but no dedicated distance-learning portal or ODeL URL is published."],"estimated_student_count":null}}', '{"context.courses":{"status":"not_found","rationale":"The 18 programme entries come from the school and Buhler pages, which could not be re-fetched; the register entry carries no course listing. Entries retained unchanged; no new facts added.","url_checked":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/"},"basic_info.email":{"status":"not_found","rationale":"The Buhler location page that publishes ams.nairobi@buhlergroup.com could not be re-fetched this run (all extractor channels quota-blocked). Retained, unconfirmed.","url_checked":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html"},"basic_info.phone":{"status":"not_found","rationale":"The line +254 793 262 506 is published only on the unreachable Buhler page; retained, unconfirmed.","url_checked":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html"},"personal_contacts":{"status":"not_found","rationale":"Kipyegon Korir is named as course coordinator on Buhler''s location page, which could not be re-fetched, so the officer listing cannot be corroborated live. Contact retained unchanged; no new facts added.","url_checked":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations/african-milling-school.html"},"basic_info.website":{"status":"not_found","rationale":"School domain could not be loaded through any available channel; the register lists no URL field, so the value stands unconfirmed.","url_checked":"https://www.africanmillingschool.com/"},"context.accreditations":{"status":"confirmed","rationale":"Register row confirms TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0004/2016 with status ''Registered and Licensed'' and expiry 2026-11-24, matching the stored accreditation.","url_checked":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/accredited-tvet-institutions"},"basic_info.location.town":{"status":"not_found","rationale":"Town Ruiru comes from the unreachable Buhler location page; retained, unconfirmed.","url_checked":"https://www.buhlergroup.com/global/en/locations