nces, instructor rating, radio telephony and a junior drone program.","courses":[{"name":"Air Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"IATA"},{"name":"Air Operations and Flight Dispatch","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"IATA"},{"name":"Remote Pilot License (Multi rotor rating)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KCAA"},{"name":"Remote Pilot License (Fixed wing rating)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KCAA"},{"name":"Remote Pilot Authorization Certificate","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KCAA"},{"name":"Instructor Rating","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KCAA"},{"name":"Radio Telephony License","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KCAA"},{"name":"Junior Drone Program","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KCAA"}],"sources":{"context.about":["https://africanairgroup.com/","https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2024","https://mail.kcaa.or.ke/sites/default/files/docs/uas/Updated-UTO-28-March-2025.pdf"],"context.courses":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2024","https://africanairgroup.com/","https://africanairgroup.com/index.php/junior-drone-program"],"context.description":["https://africanairgroup.com/","https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2024","https://mail.kcaa.or.ke/sites/default/files/docs/uas/Updated-UTO-28-March-2025.pdf"],"context.accreditations":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2024","https://mail.kcaa.or.ke/sites/default/files/docs/uas/Updated-UTO-28-March-2025.pdf","https://africanairgroup.com/"]},"facilities":null,"description":"Africanair Training Institute is listed in the TVET Authority register under TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2024, registered on 2024-05-15 with a licence expiring 2029-05-14, and classified as a private Technical and Vocational College in Nairobi County. The register records four award rows which collapse to two distinct courses once de-duplicated: Air Operations and Air Operations and Flight Dispatch, both examined by the International Air Transport Association, with register level annotations of Canada - Certificate and Canada - Diploma respectively normalised to the schema levels Certificate and Diploma. Its live website (africanairgroup.com), operated as Africanair Group, presents a drone-focused curricular portfolio beyond the register rows: Remote Pilot License (multi rotor and fixed wing ratings), Remote Pilot Authorization Certificate, Instructor Rating, Radio Telephony License and a TVET-approved Junior Drone Program for learners aged 5-18. The institute is a Kenya Civil Aviation Authority approved Unmanned Training Organization and Quality Assurance Service Provider, and an independent KCAA UTO listing (as at 28 March 2025) names AFRICANAIR GROUPE LIMITED in Nairobi with an africanairgroup.com email address. It operates from Westend place along Mai Mahiu Road, Nairobi West, advertises online, physical and blended learning modes, and publishes training@africanairgroup.com and WhatsApp +254114100205 as its contact channels.","accreditations":["TVET Authority registration TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2024","Kenya Civil Aviation Authority (KCAA): approved Unmanned Training Organization and Quality Assurance Service Provider"]},"basic_info":{"email":"training@africanairgroup.com","phone":"+254114100205","sources":{"email":["https://africanairgroup.com/","https://mail.kcaa.or.ke/sites/default/files/docs/uas/Updated-UTO-28-March-2025.pdf"],"phone":["https://africanairgroup.com/"],"website":["https://africanairgroup.com/"],"logo_url":["https://africanairgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/africanair-website-logo.png"],"basic_info.location.town":["https://africanairgroup.com/","https://maps.google.com/?cid=9437213243439334096&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA"],"basic_info.location.county":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0055/2024","https://maps.google.com/?cid