is a public TVET institution registered by TVETA as a Technical and Vocational College under TVETA/PUBLIC/TVC/0005/2018. The register shows registration on 12 April 2018 with a licence valid to 23 January 2029 and a status of Registered and Licensed. The college is located in Mombasa County in the Coast region. Its published programmes span KASNEB accountancy, KNEC artisan, craft and diploma courses in automotive, mechanical, electrical, fashion, hospitality and tourism, NITA trade tests in electrical, motor vehicle, refrigeration, tailoring and welding, and CDACC competency-based courses at certificate and diploma level. The college''s own contact page, fetched on 2026-10-30, publishes the address Mwingo - Changamwe, Mombasa with the telephone lines 0739 209 337 and 0746 748 481 and the e-mail address info@ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke, so the settlement Mombasa and the street line Mwingo, Changamwe are recorded from that page.","accreditations":["TVETA registration TVETA/PUBLIC/TVC/0005/2018, registered 2018-04-12, licence valid to 2029-01-23, status Registered and Licensed"]},"basic_info":{"email":"info@ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke","phone":"0746 748481","sources":{"email":"https://www.ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke/contact","phone":"https://www.ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke/contact","website":"https://www.ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke/","location":"https://www.ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke/contact","location.town":"https://www.ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke/contact","location.county":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA%2FPUBLIC%2FTVC%2F0005%2F2018"},"website":"https://www.ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke/","location":{"town":"Mombasa","county":"Mombasa County","region":"Coast","location":"Mwingo, Changamwe, Mombasa"},"logo_url":null},"personal_contacts":[],"institution_profile":{"type":"TVET","sources":{"type":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA%2FPUBLIC%2FTVC%2F0005%2F2018","campuses":"https://www.ahmedmwidanitvc.ac.ke/contact","category":"https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-detai