rials/","https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017"],"accreditations":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017"],"has_teaching_courses":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-aic-nairobi-training-center","https://aiccad.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/NTC-profilepdf.pdf"],"has_distance_learning":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017"]}', 64, 'researched', '2026-10-24 09:16:03.56084+00', '2026-11-21 16:25:25.643189+00', 'applied', '2026-11-21 16:25:25.130596+00', '5d218bdeffe6', '[{"settled":true,"decision":"new_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: sourced teaching-courses correction (False -> True).","decided_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143085+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"has_teaching_courses","settled_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143085+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-aic-nairobi-training-center","https://aiccad.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/NTC-profilepdf.pdf"],"stored_value":[false,"The approved awards are hospitality, catering and electrical qualifications; no teacher-training programme is registered."],"fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":[true,"Electrical Installation (Artisan)","Food and Beverage (Artisan)","Catering and Accommodation Management (Diploma)","Electrical Wireman (Trade Test)","Diploma in Early Childhood Teacher Education (DECTE)","Tailoring (Certificate)","Pastry and Bakery (Certificate)"],"locked_by_verification":false},{"settled":true,"decision":"stored_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: free-text reworded; canonical narrative kept (reword is not a conflict).","decided_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143120+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"about","settled_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143120+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017","https://aiccad.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/NTC-profilepdf.pdf"],"stored_value":"AIC - Nairobi Training Centre is a private technical and vocational college in Nairobi County registered by the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority under number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017, registered on 16 February 2017 and recorded as registered and licensed with a licence expiry date of 28 November 2028. Its approved portfolio covers hospitality, catering and electrical trades at artisan and diploma level.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"AIC - Nairobi Training Centre is a private Africa Inland Church technical and vocational college in Nairobi County, registered by TVETA under TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017, offering KNEC, NITA, KASNEB and CDACC-accredited courses in electrical trades, catering, hospitality, ICT, business and education from its Jamhuri Estate campus in Woodley, Nairobi.","locked_by_verification":true},{"settled":true,"decision":"stored_wins","rationale":"Auto-sync: free-text reworded; canonical narrative kept (reword is not a conflict).","decided_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143130+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"description","settled_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143130+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017","https://aiccad.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/NTC-profilepdf.pdf","https://education.co.ke/aic-nairobi-training-centre-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-aic-nairobi-training-center","https://www.facebook.com/p/AIC-Nairobi-Training-Centre-61559482841460/"],"stored_value":"AIC - Nairobi Training Centre appears in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as a private TVC in Nairobi County, registered on 16 February 2017 under number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017 and recorded as Registered and Licensed with an expiry date of 28 November 2028. The register lists six course rows but two of them are exact duplicates, so after de-duplication four distinct awards remain: KNEC artisan qualifications in Electrical Installation and in Food and Beverage, a KNEC Diploma in Catering and Accommodation Management, and a NITA Trade Test qualification as an Electrical Wireman. The KNEC artisan awards and the NITA Trade Test both sit at the schema level Artisan and the diploma at Diploma, following the level normalisation convention used across this research programme, and the printed examining body is preserved for each award. The centre publishes no institutional website, e-mail address or telephone number in a fetched source, so those identity fields are null; the telephone number held on the imported record could not be traced to any fetched page and is therefore not carried into this draft, and the town remains unknown rather than inferred from the imported address string.","fact_check_url":null,"proposed_value":"AIC - Nairobi Training Centre appears in the TVETA register of accredited TVET institutions as a private TVC in Nairobi County, registered on 16 February 2017 under number TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017 and recorded as Registered and Licensed with an expiry date of 28 November 2028. The register table lists four distinct awards after de-duplication: KNEC artisan qualifications in Electrical Installation and in Food and Beverage, a KNEC Diploma in Catering and Accommodation Management, and a NITA Trade Test qualification as an Electrical Wireman. The institution is a training department of the Africa Inland Church, whose parent-body profile places it at Woodley, Jamhuri, Nairobi, with postal address P.O. Box 21882-00505 Nairobi and telephone 020 5238491, and advertises a wider portfolio including ICT, Social Work and Community Development, ECDE and DPTE teacher-training programmes. Third-party programme listings additionally show KASNEB professional courses (CPA and ATD), NITA craft courses in Tailoring and Tie and Dye Techniques, and a CDACC certificate in Pastry and Bakery. The institution''s own Facebook page describes it as ''a private TVET committed to offering quality vocational and educational training for the modern world'' and advertises January intakes in catering, cosmetology, plumbing, electrical, fashion and design, masonry, mechanics, ICT, education, and social work and community development.","locked_by_verification":true},{"settled":true,"decision":"merge","rationale":"Auto-sync: deterministic non-destructive array/course union.","decided_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143140+00:00","decided_by":"rule:auto-sync","field_path":"courses","settled_at":"2026-11-21T16:25:25.143140+00:00","source_urls":["https://www.tveta.go.ke/institution-details/?details=TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0145/2017","https://www.colleges.co.ke/colleges/view-aic-nairobi-training-center","https://education.co.ke/aic-nairobi-training-centre-courses-offered-contacts-application-procedure/"],"merged_value":[{"name":"Diploma in Early Childhood Teacher Education (DECTE)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Tailoring","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"NITA"},{"name":"Tie and Dye Techniques","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"NITA"},{"name":"Certified Public Accountants (CPA)","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KASNEB"},{"name":"Accounting Technicians Diploma (ATD)","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KASNEB"},{"name":"Catering and Accommodation Operations","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Pastry and Bakery","level":"Certificate","exam_body":"TVET CDACC"},{"name":"Electrical Installation","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Food and Beverage","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Catering and Accommodation Management","level":"Diploma","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Electrical Wireman","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"NITA"}],"stored_value":[{"name":"Electrical Installation","level":"Artisan","exam_body":"KNEC"},{"name":"Food and Bevera